{"pageProps":{"story":{"name":"Unfreeze My Rights","created_at":"2025-04-14T14:35:31.466Z","published_at":"2025-04-30T09:36:20.182Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:36:20.198Z","id":655202124,"uuid":"b7586812-459a-41df-8638-328e60df7feb","content":{"_uid":"a9af7d85-4805-4329-b71b-f5b2dea94b84","title":"Unfreeze My Rights","video":[{"_uid":"0db1ae8b-d799-463b-bda5-6a7655327b86","component":"video","vimeo_url":"https://vimeo.com/1080122569/bd892cec54","hosted_video":{"id":null,"alt":null,"name":"","focus":null,"title":null,"source":null,"filename":"","copyright":null,"fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{}},"poster_image":{"id":21851090,"alt":"Photo of the woman who advertised the fake marriage proposal stunt facing the camera straight on","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/155984/1792x1008/191a14bbae/1_unfreeze-my-rights.jpg","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{"alt":"Photo of the woman who advertised the fake marriage proposal stunt facing the camera straight on","title":"","source":"","copyright":""},"is_external_url":false}}],"client":"Women Empowerment Office, CWO x Awakening Foundation","modules":[{"_uid":"4b0a0915-d6ef-42ad-8407-38189479663c","quote":"A provocative stunt highlighted the absurdity of excluding unmarried women from accessing their frozen eggs, sparking nationwide conversation and leading to legislative reform.","credit":"","component":"quote_block","use_accent_color":false},{"_uid":"218fe07d-0ec5-481d-974c-9a15d53800ca","text":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":6},"content":[{"text":"Challenge ","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"text":"Outdated Reproductive Laws","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"In Taiwan, only 8% of women use their frozen eggs—not because they don’t want to, but because of a law from 2007. Women must be married and get their husband's consent to use their eggs, thus excluding single, divorced, and same-sex women couples. Shockingly, 80% of women are unaware of this law when they first choose to freeze their eggs.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"So not only did we need to raise awareness about this unfair law but also advocate for urgent legal action.","type":"text"}]}]},"component":"rich_text","use_accent_color":false},{"_uid":"b64fa9e0-b9f4-43c4-a08f-59c19ede8c90","image":{"id":21851089,"alt":"Photo of the woman from the fake marriage proposal stunt facing the camera with the text Unfreeze My Rights and My egg, I decide next to her on the right of the image","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/155984/1920x1080/623b5f7a3b/2_unfreeze-my-rights.jpg","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{"alt":"Photo of the woman from the fake marriage proposal stunt facing the camera with the text Unfreeze My Rights and My egg, I decide next to her on the right of the image","title":"","source":"","copyright":""},"is_external_url":false},"caption":"","component":"image_block","layout_size":"full-width","use_accent_color":false,"no_inner_parallax":false},{"_uid":"26129ff0-bd1e-44a3-ac1d-0133a194fb25","text":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":6},"content":[{"text":"Approach ","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"text":"PUBLIC SPECTACLE FOR LEGAL CHANGE","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"In order to transform a legal restriction into a public conversation, we had to do something shocking to drive awareness and action. ","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"We not only shared a series of real stories—revealing truths that had never been fully understood and sparking conversations among women—we also went beyond traditional advocacy methods. The campaign leveraged experiential storytelling to make the issue deeply personal. By staging a public “marriage proposal” on Mother’s Day—a day symbolizing motherhood—the campaign immediately captured public and media attention.","type":"text"}]}]},"component":"rich_text","use_accent_color":false},{"_uid":"c109c139-4937-41fc-8058-14b17e4fc0c2","image":{"id":21851092,"alt":"Five still black and white frames taken from the testimonial videos of women sitting while sharing their personal stories","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/155984/2972x1672/7bce477703/3_unfreeze-my-rights.jpg","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{"alt":"Five still black and white frames taken from the testimonial videos of women sitting while sharing their personal stories","title":"","source":"","copyright":""},"is_external_url":false},"caption":"","component":"image_block","layout_size":"large","use_accent_color":false,"no_inner_parallax":true},{"_uid":"9d171f2c-31a1-4443-a92b-7a1ae9f642ec","text":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":6},"content":[{"text":"Solution","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"text":"TRANSFORMING CURIOSITY INTO ACTION","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"The campaign was executed as a bold, real-world activation designed to spark conversation and mobilize action. On Mother’s Day, not Valentine’s Day, a middle-aged woman staged a public marriage proposal in Taipei’s busy Xinyi district. Instead of a romantic declaration, her proposal was unusual: she didn’t seek love, wealth, or companionship—just a signature to meet Taiwan’s legal requirement for using her frozen eggs.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Strategically placed large-scale outdoor ads reinforced the message, with a QR code leading curious passersby to a digital platform. Here, they discovered the real stories of women impacted by the outdated law and were encouraged to sign a petition for legislative change.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"To maximize exposure, the stunt was designed for virality, ensuring media and social platforms picked up the story. News outlets, influencers, and advocacy groups amplified the campaign, helping it reach 99% of mainstream media and exceed its petition goal by 300%.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"As momentum grew, the campaign video was sent to key legislators, adding political pressure. Many companies joined the movement, publicly showing their support. The overwhelming public response led to the government drafting a bill to grant single women and same-sex couples reproductive rights, proving that a staged “fake” marriage could drive very real change.","type":"text"}]}]},"component":"rich_text","use_accent_color":false},{"_uid":"ac1e27b6-b1ad-4d92-b680-824e92c4b88e","images":[{"id":21851088,"alt":"Photo of Out of Home campaign large format poster on side of a truck crossing through an urban  traffic intersection","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/155984/2154x1215/d0850469a1/4_unfreeze-my-rights.jpg","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{"alt":"Photo of Out of Home campaign large format poster on side of a truck crossing through an urban  traffic intersection","title":"","source":"","copyright":""}},{"id":21851093,"alt":"Black and white photograph of a woman's face looking to the left off screen","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/155984/1744x1744/9b7b5ba431/5_unfreeze-my-rights.jpg","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{"alt":"Black and white photograph of a woman's face looking to the left off screen","title":"","source":"","copyright":""}},{"id":21851091,"alt":"Photo of Out of Home campaign posters on three yellow taxis in a row on a tree-lined street","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/155984/2157x1218/b2cd93b328/6_unfreeze-my-rights.jpg","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{"alt":"Photo of Out of Home campaign posters on three yellow taxis in a row on a tree-lined street","title":"","source":"","copyright":""}}],"component":"image_grid_fluid","use_accent_color":false,"no_inner_parallax":true},{"_uid":"b50b1b5b-2fdb-4e08-ae3d-5bbb7fa45c7c","values":[{"_uid":"e0c4989d-0a03-4ad3-b7fc-fec61cb22667","number":"300","component":"statistic","unit_left":"+","unit_right":"%","description":"Petition target exceeded in under one week"},{"_uid":"964078ae-0184-44e7-ba40-fb01d117b48e","number":"50","component":"statistic","unit_left":"","unit_right":"M","description":"Social media impressions"},{"_uid":"6ed7950c-34f0-4027-87fc-a8816ecf72af","number":"99","component":"statistic","unit_left":"","unit_right":"%","description":"Mainstream media reached"}],"component":"statistics","use_accent_color":false}],"category":["Changes society"],"component":"case","countries":[],"key_image":[{"_uid":"c499194b-d4f4-4911-be9d-6add99a0a62f","alt_text":"","component":"responsive_image","image_caption":"","image_portrait":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/155984/1080x1920/10070ece86/1_unfreeze-my-rights-portrait.png","image_landscape":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/155984/1792x1008/191a14bbae/1_unfreeze-my-rights.jpg"}],"locations":[{"name":"Taiwan","created_at":"2024-04-25T14:39:39.596Z","published_at":"2026-03-27T10:30:39.877Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T10:30:39.892Z","id":484986917,"uuid":"b9b42fff-c81b-4379-adc6-102a83556c1c","content":{"_uid":"7ddf678f-3b2c-49a8-a704-3ac90945936b","city":"São Paulo","title":"Taiwan","emails":[],"region":"apac","address":"","country":"","location":"","sections":[{"_uid":"4bc28851-f3b1-49ae-9d15-89f7afa43f0c","title":"Local leadership","assets":[],"component":"image_slider_draggable","use_accent_color":false},{"_uid":"2b0949d9-bbca-4693-abd5-a742bdbd6773","line1":"Invent the","line2":"future with us","buttons":[{"_uid":"df98d7f5-3ac9-427c-87c0-e094e120de64","link":{"id":"704df6ac-b488-4391-baec-26bb6acaae9f","url":"","linktype":"story","fieldtype":"multilink","cached_url":"/en-gb/